===Etymology===
Probably from {{der|en|it|rucola}}, whence also, since c. 1967, {{m+|en|rucola}}. Also cognate to {{m|en|rocket||plant}}, {{m|en|eruca}}, {{m|en|roquette}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|GenAm}} {{enPR|əʹro͞ogələ}}, {{IPA|en|/əˈɹuɡələ/}}
* {{enPR|əʹro͝ogələ}}, {{IPA|en|/əˈɹʊɡələ/}}
* {{hyphenation|en|a|ru|gu|la}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# One of three yellowish-flowered [[Mediterranean]] [[herb]]s of the [[mustard]] family with flavoured leaves, often eaten in [[salad]]s. Has a distinct, [[peppery]] flavor:
## ''[[Eruca sativa]]'', sometimes {{taxlink|Eruca vesicaria subsp. sativa|subspecies}}
## ''[[Eruca vesicaria]]''
## {{taxlink|Diplotaxis tenuifolia|species}}

